["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"115. 對OpenAI姚順雨3小時訪談：6年Agent研究、人與系統、吞噬的邊界、既單極又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半場：通用方法已經有了，難的是找任務</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚順雨說 AI 主線已從「造武器」進入「選戰場」——方法終於通用了，但真正的瓶頸不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人腦子裡的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"五條人之仁科×羅永浩！近五個小時的變態超長對談！ X先生 時光列車 迪倫精神\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-10-cn2d7912-土味美学不是设计出来的-而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78ad6d4d665acca7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:37:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>土味美學不是設計出來的，而是貧窮生活裡自然長出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說這套土味美學不是提前設計的風格策略，而是像希臘神廟的柱子褪色一樣，被貧窮歲月自然磨出來的真實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獨立音樂</span><span class=\"tag\">鄉土美學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"114. 與殷一、歐迪聊聊薩洛蒙：中國意外的增長閥門、小眾越野跑與少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年沒變，薩洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國越野跑核心人群十年前十萬人，今年還是十萬人，區別是老了十歲。薩洛蒙沒丟專業線，靠女性拉新把會員從十萬做到八百萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">戶外運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何廣智×羅永浩！何廣智：我到長安了 callback cue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-01-cn2d7912-何广智-做好人比做坏人容易-因为伪装太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c82a199f8115741a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>何廣智：做好人比做壞人容易，因為偽裝太難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何廣智說：選擇當好人不是天性，是算準了做好事幾乎必有回報，而當壞人必須八面玲瓏、不能露一絲破綻，門檻太高、太難偽裝了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">創作方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"113. 和楊植麟時隔1年的對話：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之腦和“站在無限的開端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像訓模型：SFT 太多，團隊就沒有創造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟楊植麟講：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告訴人該怎麼做，太多，人就沒有主觀能動性；RL 只給獎勵，但獎勵定義不好，全隊都會去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何小鵬×羅永浩！何小鵬講述從財富自由奔赴無盡地獄模式的創業故事 soul side Tops\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-26-cn2d7912-何小鹏-造车十年-没有一家中国车企真正拿到船票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f6e10cb84ed08b87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：造車十年，沒有一家中國車企真正拿到船票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何小鵬說中國新能源車的淘汰賽大概五年內見分曉，最後大概留下五家，但眼下每一家、包括小鵬自己，都還沒拿到那張船票。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">造車新勢力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研發投入</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×羅永浩！四小時馬拉松訪談！李想首度公開講述 25 年創業之路 GTD PHEV e-power\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-19-cn2d7912-李想-顶级企业家共同点不是选得准-而是反人性高频迭代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9a33a06a8261b5e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:56:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>李想：頂級企業家共同點不是選得準，而是反人性高頻迭代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說頂級企業家選對賽道、能長期堅持只是入場門檻，真正拉開差距的是黃仁勳、字節、美團那種反人性的高頻市場迭代速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"112. 和廣密聊大模型季報：分化與收斂、全家桶與垂直整合、L4體驗與挖礦窗口 Reward Hacking L4 體驗 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖礦的，產品公司是煉礦的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖礦的窗口正在縮短：從兩年到九個月再到三四個月。基礎模型公司開始端到端做 Agent，應用公司的成本劣勢是結構性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"111. 李一帆口述激光雷達11年創業史：你仔細想行業的機會來自哪？是國家、民族的機會 ASIC ITC POC Robotaxi Tier 1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-07-zhangxiaojun-激光雷达降价-99-5-靠的不是上量而是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a07079c1963cee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:08:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>激光雷達降價 99.5%，靠的不是上量而是設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硬件的降本不來自規模，來自設計能力：把幾十萬一臺的激光雷達做進芯片，才可能從功能件變成安全件，最後變成標配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激光雷達</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"110. 逐段講解Kimi K2報告並對照ChatGPT Agent、Qwen3-Coder等：“系統工程的力量” MCP KV Cache verifiable reward reward hacking persona partial rollout\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-30-zhangxiaojun-kimi-k2-把配方全公开了-但复现它仍是手艺活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4a70954860f9ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>Kimi K2 把配方全公開了，但復現它仍是手藝活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K2 報告把數據合成、可驗證獎勵、RL 基礎設施的 recipe 全寫出來了，但每個 prompt、每個參數都要調穩，本質是系統工程而非 idea。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Kimi K2</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"109. 機器人遭遇數據荒？與謝晨聊：仿真與合成數據、Meta天價收購和Alexandr Wang Sim2Real Real2Sim data pyramid cross embodiment acquihire scaling law moment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-15-zhangxiaojun-仿真不等于仿真器-机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17864fa8278d8825-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>仿真不等於仿真器：機器人數據荒裡最賺錢的是原料商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能還在 GPT-1 階段，沒找到 scaling law 的配方。真正卡住行業的是高質量物理資產和場景，而不是仿真器——所以做仿真器的人反而最不賺錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">合成數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"108. 余凱口述30年史：世界不止刀光劍影，是一部人來人往的江湖故事 PMF Cuda Baseband HMI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-07-zhangxiaojun-科学家创业最大的-bug-不知道客户是谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b30b49056fd22ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>科學家創業最大的 bug：不知道客戶是誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">地平線前五年在空調、玩具、家電、汽車之間 360 度掃射，2019 年砍掉一半人、歐印汽車，才從亂打亂撞變成戰略驅動的公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"107. 和夢秋的catch-up：創投挺無聊，也聊聊旅行讀書和女性主義 sim2real general purpose agent reductive\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-29-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用没找到场景-deepseek-也没繁荣创业生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c74c419a6b9140d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0629</span></div>\n<h2>AI 應用沒找到場景，DeepSeek 也沒繁榮創業生態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">清流資本王夢秋的判斷：資本寒冬沒過去，DeepSeek 抹平了信息差卻沒造出新場景，通用 Agent 可能是偽命題，真正剛需的是垂直工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"106. 和王鶴聊，具身智能的學術邊緣史和資本轟炸後的人為亂象 sim2real VLA perception action loop object goal navigation six dof pose\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-22-zhangxiaojun-机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术-是摇操和讲故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d36c7ae97ae40ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>機器人公司最大的敵人不是技術，是搖操和講故事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王鶴說這一代具身智能公司只有兩條死路：長期漂著講故事，或者每個場景從頭重做。他押注合成數據，真實數據只佔訓練量的1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"105. 和奔馳王忻聊，產業大轉折下的德國汽車、話語權和技術battle Tier 1 QNX Rule-based 端到端 SOA V2X\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-19-zhangxiaojun-奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41a98711cc822d74-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0619</span></div>\n<h2>奔馳中國團隊用數據跟德國總部搶話語權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tier 1 黑盒交付的時代結束了，主機廠要自己 operate 數據。中國團隊不是把話語權奪過來的，是承諾、交付、建立信任換來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">智能駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"104. 和Rokid祝銘明聊，吳媽、阿里、硬件創業黑森林的第11年 Always on System Cost PMF 敢為人後\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-15-zhangxiaojun-ai-会取代手机-但赢家可能不是手机厂商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cce440d4536846b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0615</span></div>\n<h2>AI 會取代手機，但贏家可能不是手機廠商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祝銘明說 AI 一定會取代手機，但眼鏡不是贏者通吃的生意，最多十家分桌吃飯；他賭的是大廠看不見、看不懂、看不上、來不及的那兩三年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能眼鏡</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"103. Lovart創始人陳冕復盤應用創業這兩年：這一刻就是好爽啊！！哈哈哈哈哈 PMF agentic workflow break even\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-08-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用创业-通用-agent-吃不掉垂类-第一年差点死掉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/63ceb3c5d2d844aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>AI 應用創業：通用 Agent 吃不掉垂類，第一年差點死掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陳冕復盤：第一代產品贏了補貼戰卻被下架，賬上只剩 4000 塊；垂類 Agent 的機會在於通用模型吃不下行業數據和交互，前提是 AGI 五年內不來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">垂類 Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"102. 和張祥雨聊，多模態研究的掙扎史和未來兩年的2個“GPT-4時刻” next token prediction critical decision Meta-CoT feature collapse environment scaling Linear Transformer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-02-zhangxiaojun-多模态缺的不是架构-是视觉空间里的思维链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/653276f39f011f45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:28:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0602</span></div>\n<h2>多模態缺的不是架構，是視覺空間裡的思維鏈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">圖像的理解、生成、人類對齊三者天然割裂，因為圖像來自大自然、不包含人類對它的理解；生成模型至今還停在語言模型「一口爆」的原始形態，連 CoT 都沒有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多模態</span><span class=\"tag\">思維鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"101. 對YouWare創始人明超平3小時訪談：今天Agent像大猩猩剛拿起一根燒火棍 per token valuation web coder agent rank the bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-05-28-zhangxiaojun-agent-像大猩猩刚拿起烧火棍-token-消耗速度才是关键指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a30891133f762c8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 像大猩猩剛拿起燒火棍，token 消耗速度才是關鍵指標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明超平把 AI 產品的關鍵指標從 DAU 換成 token 消耗速度，又進一步改成 per token valuation——因為 token 消耗大不代表價值高，就像石油轉化為機械能的效率才是關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">產品方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"100. 對話奔馳全球CEO康林松：轉型期CEO和轉型之中的139歲奔馳 MBOS L3 CLTC ECU\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-05-23-zhangxiaojun-奔驰ceo-2030年若市场不纯电-我们两种车都造/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae02e39916eeef4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">57:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>奔馳CEO：2030年若市場不純電，我們兩種車都造</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">康林松不賭單一技術路線：堅持2030年前推出完整電動車序列，同時保留燃油和電動兩種選擇。他判斷中國是節奏最快、競爭壓力最大的市場，能在中國贏，在全球贏的概率就更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">電動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"99. 對能量奇點創始人楊釗3小時訪談：人類馴服可控核聚變還有多少路程？ Q值 三乘積 托卡馬克 高溫超導 FRC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-04-28-zhangxiaojun-聚变真正的原料不是氘氚-是氘氘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e4068698af4899d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0428</span></div>\n<h2>聚變真正的原料不是氘氚，是氘氘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氘氚路線要邊發電邊造氚，監管和成本都高；氘氘不涉氚，才是規模化商業電站的前提，但三乘積要從21次方再上一個數量級。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可控核聚變</span><span class=\"tag\">高溫超導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"98. 逐篇講解機器人基座模型和VLA經典論文——“人就是最智能的VLA” VLA Action Chunking Transformer Model Predictive Control Co-Fine Tuning Diffusion Policy Unified Action Space\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-04-06-zhangxiaojun-机器人不需要等到-aha-moment-才落地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebe187bae6eda636-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0406</span></div>\n<h2>機器人不需要等到 aha moment 才落地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機器人領域還沒出現大模型那種 aha moment，但能力提升的斜率已經起來了，每一年每一個月的能力增長都會沿途解鎖新的商業機會，不用等通用智能成熟再找應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"97. 25年Q1大模型季報：和廣密聊當下最大非共識、AGI的主線與主峰 Pretraining Post Training RL Tool Use Long Context Online Learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-03-30-zhangxiaojun-预训练才是主峰-智能本身就是最大的应用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c27ae452558c5f81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>預訓練才是主峰：智能本身就是最大的應用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司；但今天最大的紅利是承接研究溢出的智能，而不是做產品拉動的應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"96. 和郎鹹朋聊，自動駕駛10年演進史、關鍵技術細節和特斯拉 BEV Transformer VLM MPI VLA 3DGS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-03-16-zhangxiaojun-l3-不是-l2-的延长-而是-l4-的先导/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46bac62b6c4b8b63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>L3 不是 L2 的延長，而是 L4 的先導</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">理想自動駕駛團隊用端到端把 200 萬行代碼砍到 20 萬行，縱向控制第一次超過所有競品——不是人更聰明，是終於用做能力而不是做功能的方式做自動駕駛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">端到端</span>\n</div></div></a>"]